  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n 7(5)/(8) + (5)/(8) of 184 × 15 ÷ 5 - (?) = 0\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c6dff4d58ce66b38e0cdda1b0a721fa32c2ef301f704e653b2f493673a6e332b.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 7(5)/(8) + (5)/(8) of 184 × 15 ÷ 5 - (?) = 0\n\n⇒ 7(5)/(8) + 115 × 15 ÷ 5 - (?) = 0\n\n⇒ 7(5)/(8) + 115 × 3 = (?)\n\n⇒ 7(5)/(8) + 345 = (?)\n\n⇒ 7 + (5)/(8) + 345 = (?)\n\n⇒ 352 (5)/(8)\n\n**∴ Option 4 is the correct answer.**",
